  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN DPKO/DFS contribution to implement the Peace Operations Reform Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the UN Department of Peacekeeping Operations and the UN Department of Field Support to implement the agenda proposed by the High-level Panel on Peace Operations (June 2016) and the UN Secretary-General&apos;s report (September 2016) - to make peace operations more effective, efficient, responsive, accountable and gender sensitive.</narrative>
  </description>
